:: MP Region Glasshouse Orchid Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你蹲在大理石花坛背阴侧，伸手探向覆着白石英砂的排水暗格。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 780>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 680>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 600>><<else>><<set _reward to 520>><</if>>
	<<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"] to 1>>
	<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Glasshouse_Orchid")>>
		你拨开石英砂取出密封锦盒，里面放着古董玉瓶与双生银丝花标本。盒底还垫着约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的沙龙赏金。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragBrideFlower to ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		你在大理石花神像倾斜的底座下摸出了几枚宾客遗落的银币，数下来大约有 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
		<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	花架上的血色猪笼草突然倾倒洒出粘稠液滴，花刺也在你的手背上划出一道血痕。你连忙缩手退开。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回雾化兰花厅 (0:02)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

