<<if !$mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] or !$mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] or !$mpKnown["blackiron_platform"]>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[顺着铁轨排摸 (0:06)|MP Region Blackiron Yard Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[向巡道老工打听 (0:05)|MP Region Blackiron Yard Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回麋鹿街 (0:09)|Elk Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<pass 9>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Region Blackiron Yard Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你压低身形沿着道岔扳手往前摸索，借着龙门吊的阴影观察停靠的车皮与砖楼。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or $athletics gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["blackiron_armored"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] to 1>>
		你顺着副股道新磨亮的钢轨寻去，在防雨棚下找到了铆接厚钢板的三号装甲货车。<<stress -2>>
	<<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_signal"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] to 1>>
		你沿着电报线杆往北看，发现了可以俯瞰整片调车场的二层砖木信号值班室。<<stress -2>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>>
		你绕到卸货仓库后方的斜坡下，找到了连通港区暗渠的地下走私月台入口。<<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	靴底踩滑了一块尖锐的道砟碎石，脚踝猛地一扭，远处巡逻哨的探照灯束也扫了过来。你连忙缩回红砖墙后。<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回货运站入口 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Blackiron Yard Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
给水塔下蹲着一名擦拭扳手的巡道老工，你走过去向他打听场站深处的动静。
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4400>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or $skulduggery gte 280 or $physique gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["blackiron_armored"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] to 1>>
		「林恩提过你会来查车皮，」老工用扳手点了点北侧副线，「那节铆钢板的三号装甲货车就停在闷罐车后面。」<<stress -2>>
	<<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_signal"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] to 1>>
		「想查发报底单就上东头那座信号塔值班室，」老工压低声音道，「外侧铁梯的插销没锁死。」<<stress -2>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>>
		「黑市夜班货都不走明面，」老工朝三号仓库地底指了指，「顺着货运滑道下去就是地下走私月台。」<<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	「调车重地，闲杂人等快走开，」老工拎起信号灯晃了晃，板着脸不肯多说半句。<<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回货运站入口 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Blackiron Siding [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_siding"] to 1>>
布满道岔扳手的铁轨汇集区里，枯黄的野草从枕木缝隙间钻出地面。几节脱轨的敞篷煤车歪斜在止冲挡旁，铁壳在风里发出沉闷的轻响。
<<if $physique gte 11500 or $athletics gte 260>>你利落地跨过生锈的道岔拉杆，落脚悄无声息。<<else>>横七竖八的枕木与铁拉杆很容易绊住脚踝。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[撬开扳道暗盒 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Siding Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[躲进车厢歇脚 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Siding Rest]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[搜寻周边奇遇 (0:08)|MP Region Pool Router]]>><<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Blackiron">><<set $mpReturnPassage to "MP Region Blackiron Siding">><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往三号装甲车 (0:08)|MP Region Blackiron Armored]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往信号值班室 (0:06)|MP Region Blackiron Signal]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往地下装卸台 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回货运站入口 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Blackiron Siding Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你蹲在七号道岔扳道器旁，用铁片去别铸铁基座侧面的检修暗盒。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 780>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 680>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 600>><<else>><<set _reward to 520>><</if>>
	<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] to 1>>
	<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Blackiron_Siding")>>
		暗盒铁盖应声崩开，你取出了一枚早期铁路纪念金章与孤儿院账册铜匙。盒底油布里还裹着约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的押车津贴。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragLedgerKey or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragLedgerKey to ($mpFragLedgerKey or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		你在缓冲器下方的防水布袋里翻出了几枚铁路工人的银币，清点下来约有 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
		<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	生锈的扳道弹簧突然回弹，沉重的铁柄擦着你的膝盖砸下，震得你虎口发麻。你只好空手退开。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 3>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回废弃调车场 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Blackiron Siding Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
你翻进一节背风的敞篷车厢角落坐下，借着高耸的钢铁车壁挡住工业区的夜风。
<<if $physique gte 11500 or $willpower gte 430>>
	厚重的车体隔开了外面的寒流，你抱膝靠在干燥的木箱边缓了口气，紧绷的小腿渐渐恢复了力气。
	<<tiredness -4>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
	车厢底板缝隙里钻出阵阵刺骨的穿堂冷风，煤灰味呛得你鼻腔发酸。你缩在角落里非但没歇好，反而浑身僵冷。
	<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回废弃调车场 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

