	<</if>>
<<else>>
	起重滑轮的铁链猛地滑脱一寸，配重铁箱重重磕在石台上，夹伤了你的手指。你忍痛收回手退到立柱后。
	<<stress 6>><<pain 3>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回地下装卸台 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Blackiron Platform Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
你挑了两只干燥的樟木货箱之间坐下，听着水闸外平缓的暗渠流水声。
<<if $willpower gte 460 or $skulduggery gte 280>>
	淡淡的樟木清香掩去了地底的潮气，隐蔽的货箱死角让你安心地缓过劲来，体力恢复了不少。
	<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
	水闸门的铜钟被暗浪冲得叮当乱响，像是有暗哨正在靠近，吓得你立刻绷紧身体站了起来。
	<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回地下装卸台 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Circle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_pillars"] to 1>>
穿过古木参天的深林迷雾，高大的风化花岗岩石柱在林间空地上围成一圈。苍翠的苔藓覆盖着脚下的腐殖土，空气中弥漫着清冽的松脂气息。
<<if $tending gte 260 or $willpower gte 450>>你顺着石柱上的螺旋符文辨清了林间方位。<<else>>浓重的林雾在巨石间流转，让人很难看清石环外围的去路。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_pillars"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往迷雾石柱群 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往月泉祭坛 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Moonwell]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往古根地穴 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往林冠瞭望台 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] or !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] or !$mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[辨认林间兽径 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Circle Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[向巡林猎手打听 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Circle Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深林 (0:14)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 14>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Circle Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你拨开低垂的槲寄生枝条，顺着石柱底座的星辰刻痕与地面兽径仔细搜寻。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or $tending gte 300 or $athletics gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>
		你顺着青石板上的引水浅槽往北走，在迷雾深处找到了清澈见底的月泉祭坛。<<stress -2>>
	<<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>>
		你绕到合抱粗的千年古橡树后方，发现了盘结树根下方干燥温暖的古根地穴入口。<<stress -2>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>>
		你仰头顺着树干上的藤编软梯望去，找到了架设在树冠分叉处的守林人瞭望台。<<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	带刺的荆棘丛划破了你的小腿，林间浓雾让你转了半圈又回到原处，白白耗费了不少力气。<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回石环入口 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Circle Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
树根石台边坐着一名给猎犬包扎爪垫的巡林猎手，你上前向他请教石环四周的隐秘路径。
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4300>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or $tending gte 260 or $willpower gte 450>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>
		「阿什说你会来采药，」猎手抬手指向正北的主石柱，「穿过那两根挂槲寄生的石柱就是月泉祭坛。」<<stress -2>>
	<<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>>
		「若是遇到林间起暴雾，就钻进东侧古橡树底下的古根地穴，」猎手拍了拍猎犬，「里头干燥又挡风。」<<stress -2>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>>
		「西南角那棵最高的老橡树上搭着守林人瞭望台，」猎手抬头示意道，「顺着木桩脚蹬就能爬上去。」<<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	「深林里雾大路滑，外人别往禁地深处乱闯，」猎手吹了声口哨唤走猎犬，没有给你指路。<<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回石环入口 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Pillars [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_pillars"] to 1>>
十二根高耸的风化花岗岩石柱在林间围成环阵，凹槽里的螺旋古符文在雨雾中泛着温润微光。两座主石柱之间拉着编满干枯槲寄生的麻绳。
<<if $history gte 260 or $tending gte 260>>你看出石柱排列暗合冬至月相的方位。<<else>>高大的巨石阵在浓雾里投下沉重的阴影。<</if>>
