	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往古根地穴 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往林冠瞭望台 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回石环入口 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Pillars Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你垫高脚尖伸手探入正北主石柱的螺旋符文凹槽，摸索里面的青铜器物。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 780>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 680>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 600>><<else>><<set _reward to 520>><</if>>
	<<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>
	<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Druid_Pillars")>>
		你巧劲拨开卡住的石楔，取出了一枚古德鲁伊青铜圣徽与银丝花标本。凹槽深处还藏着约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的奉纳古银币。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragBrideFlower to ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		你在槲寄生麻绳系着的小皮囊里翻出了几枚祈愿银币，点算下来大约有 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
		<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	石柱顶端的渡鸦旧巢突然受惊散落一地枯枝，粗糙的花岗岩棱角刮破了你的手指。你只好缩回手退下石台。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回迷雾石柱群 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Pillars Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
你背靠着正北主石柱干燥的背风面坐下，闭上眼睛呼吸着林间清冽的松脂雾气。
<<if $willpower gte 430 or $tending gte 250>>
	温润的花岗岩替你挡去了山风，草木与泥土的清香让你的呼吸渐渐平缓，一身疲乏消散了不少。
	<<tiredness -4>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
	树冠上积聚的冰凉露水突然成串滴落进你的衣领，冻得你激灵灵打了个寒颤，半点睡意也没留下。
	<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回迷雾石柱群 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Moonwell [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>
终年不涸的林间冷泉汇聚在白石砌成的月牙池内，清澈的泉水从玉蝉雕刻的出水口潺潺流过。池边石案上摆着一只三足青铜爵。
<<if $tending gte 280 or $purity gte 500>>你看出泉眼四周盛开的正是罕见的双生银丝花。<<else>>微凉的水雾笼罩着白石池面，透着沁人心脾的寒意。<</if>>
