:: MP Region Druid Moonwell Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你挽起衣袖跪在月泉白石池沿，将手探进冰凉刺骨的泉眼石缝。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 800>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 700>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 620>><<else>><<set _reward to 540>><</if>>
	<<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>>
	<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Druid_Moonwell")>>
		你从泉眼石缝里捞出一只密封银匣，里面盛着月华玉佩与双生银丝花标本。池底白砂间还拢着约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的奉纳银币。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragBrideFlower to ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		你在出水口白石槽下摸出了几枚被泉水冲刷得发亮的古银币，合计约有 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
		<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	刺骨的冷泉冻得你五指发僵，脚下青苔一滑险些栽进池中，手肘也在白石池沿磕得生疼。你只得收回手退开。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回月泉祭坛 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Moonwell]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Moonwell Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
你坐在月泉祭坛洁净的白石池畔，掬起一捧清冽的泉水洗净面庞。
<<if $willpower gte 440 or $purity gte 450>>
	甘冽微凉的泉水瞬间驱散了你眉宇间的燥热与阴霾，林间鸟鸣让你的心神彻底宁静下来。
	<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
	祭坛后方古橡树洞里的兽骨风铃突然被山风吹得哗啦乱响，幽冷的湿气让你后背直冒凉意。
	<<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
