:: MP Region Druid Watchtower [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>>
搭建在千年古橡树冠分叉处的木制瞭望台高出林海，顶层木栏上架着一具单筒黄铜望远镜。栏杆旁钉着一只防风信鸽笼，山风吹得树叶沙沙作响。
<<if $athletics gte 280 or $physique gte 11500>>你扶稳木栏极目远眺，整片深林的起伏尽在眼底。<<else>>高空摇晃的树冠平台让你双腿有些发软。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[旋开空心木柱 (0:13)|MP Region Druid Watchtower Search]]>><<pass 13>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[木栏背风小憩 (0:10)|MP Region Druid Watchtower Rest]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[搜寻周边奇遇 (0:08)|MP Region Pool Router]]>><<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Druid">><<set $mpReturnPassage to "MP Region Druid Watchtower">><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_pillars"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往迷雾石柱群 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往月泉祭坛 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Moonwell]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往古根地穴 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回石环入口 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Watchtower Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你握住瞭望台顶层望远镜架的底座，顺着木纹接缝拧动空心立柱的暗盖。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 840>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 740>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 640>><<else>><<set _reward to 550>><</if>>
	<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Druid_Watchtower")>>
		木柱暗盖旋开，你取出了一卷深林秘道图、古董银鹰哨与银丝花标本。筒底还压着约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的巡林赏金。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragBrideFlower to ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		你在中层值班室柴火堆后的饼干盒里翻出了几枚备用银币，数下来约有 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
		<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	一阵劲风吹晃树冠，木柱上的倒刺扎进了你的掌心，信鸽笼里的灰鸽也扑腾乱叫起来。你连忙缩手扶稳栏杆。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 3>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回林冠瞭望台 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Watchtower Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
你退进瞭望台中层挂着狼皮的值班室，靠着干燥的松木壁板坐下歇息。
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $willpower gte 450>>
	高出林冠的清爽山风吹散了满身闷热，松木壁板挡住了寒流，胸中的郁结一扫而空。
	<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
	狂风吹得整座木瞭望台咯吱摇晃，百叶窗框啪啪拍打着木墙，晃得你头晕眼花，半刻也坐不住。
	<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回林冠瞭望台 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Velvet Mirage [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_masque"] to 1>>
步入悬崖廊柱下的天鹅绒侧门，一条铺着暗红波斯地毯的隐秘沙龙沿着峭壁内侧延伸开来。水晶壁灯洒下暖昧的柔光，空气中浮动着白麝香与香槟的气息。
<<if $danceskill gte 260 or $beauty gte 3500>>你从容地调整呼吸，步伐优雅地融入了廊间的暗影。<<else>>华美帷幔后隐约传来的低笑声让你心跳不由得快了几拍。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $mpKnown["velvet_masque"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往假面回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["velvet_salon"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往试衣沙龙 (0:06)|MP Region Velvet Salon]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往观海雅座 (0:07)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["velvet_auction"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往拍卖暗厅 (0:09)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !$mpKnown["velvet_salon"] or !$mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] or !$mpKnown["velvet_auction"]>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[留意帷幔暗门 (0:06)|MP Region Velvet Mirage Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[向假面侍者打听 (0:05)|MP Region Velvet Mirage Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回康努达图斯街 (0:07)|Connudatus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "connudatus">><<pass 7>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Region Velvet Mirage Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你借着整理衣领的动作停在廊柱阴影里，留心观察侍者端盘出入的丝绒帷幔。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or $danceskill gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["velvet_salon"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] to 1>>
		你顺着带有金线刺绣的门帘往东看，发现了专供贵客更衣的镜面试衣沙龙入口。<<stress -2>>
	<<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_terrace"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>>
		你循着轻纱帷幔间透进来的海风声，找到了悬挑在峭壁外侧的露台观海雅座。<<stress -2>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpKnown["velvet_auction"] to 1>>
		你留意到地毯下方的黄铜地锁暗道，摸清了通往暗层最深处私人拍卖暗厅的阶梯。<<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	一名巡廊执事的目光突然扫向廊柱，你慌忙转身避让，脚跟在地毯边缘绊了一下。你没能看清帷幔后的去路。<<stress 5>><<pain 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回天鹅绒入口 (0:02)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Velvet Mirage Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
镀金香槟推车旁立着一名戴银羽半面具的侍者，你走上前轻声向他打听沙龙内厅的门道。
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or $danceskill gte 280 or $beauty gte 4000>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["velvet_salon"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] to 1>>
		「莫奈小姐关照过您的尺码，」侍者微微欠身指向东侧屏风，「屏风后面就是镜面试衣沙龙。」<<stress -2>>
	<<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_terrace"]>>
		<<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>>
		「若是觉得厅里闷，穿过西侧纱帘便是露台观海雅座，」侍者微笑着低语，「那里的海景最受贵客青睐。」<<stress -2>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpKnown["velvet_auction"] to 1>>
		「今晚的压轴拍品都在最里头的私人拍卖暗厅，」侍者压低声音指了指暗红拱门，「顺着环形阶梯下去便是。」<<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	「暗层规矩，不问来处，也不指去处，」侍者礼貌而疏离地端起托盘走开，让你无从问起。<<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回天鹅绒入口 (0:02)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

