:: MP Region Velvet Terrace Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你扶住观海雅座外侧的汉白玉栏杆，双手握住松动的雕花柱头缓缓旋开。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 380>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 860>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 750>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 650>><<else>><<set _reward to 560>><</if>>
	<<set $mpKnown["velvet_auction"] to 1>>
	<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Velvet_Terrace")>>
		空心柱头应声旋下，你取出了一份封存的名流密信与暗金假面徽章。柱槽底部还塞着约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的私密礼金。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragVelvetCrest or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragVelvetCrest to ($mpFragVelvetCrest or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		你在大理石花盆底下的防水银烟盒里翻出了几张零钞，折合大约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
		<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	冰凉的大理石柱头猛地卡死，火盆里飞出的一点银炭火星烫到了你的手腕。你连忙缩回手退回软垫边。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 3>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回观海雅座 (0:02)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Velvet Terrace Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
你拉过铸铁火盆旁的藤椅坐下，听着峭壁下方低沉规律的浪涛声。
