:: MP Region Observatory Star Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
你靠在弥漫着樟木清香的画筒架旁坐下，合上眼帘静听窗外的微风。
<<if $history gte 250 or $willpower gte 440>>
	温和醇正的书卷气与樟木香驱散了你心头的浮躁，安静的档案室让你很快恢复了充沛的精力。
	<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
	角落那台缩微胶片阅读机的散热风扇突然嗡嗡作响，待机红灯在暗处不停闪烁，晃得你心烦意乱。
	<<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回星图档案室 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Observatory Cabinet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>>
内侧暗阁的玻璃展柜里陈列着早期自然科学标本、紫水晶簇与光学棱镜。东壁挂着一幅古生物化石石板，夜光萤石在暗处散发出柔和的浅绿微光。
<<if $science gte 280 or $history gte 260>>你注意到最底层紫水晶簇的木底座留有合页缝隙。<<else>>形态各异的化石与矿石晶簇在幽暗中显得格外冷峻。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[检查水晶底座 (0:13)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet Search]]>><<pass 13>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[萤石柜旁调息 (0:10)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet Rest]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[搜寻周边奇遇 (0:08)|MP Region Pool Router]]>><<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Observatory">><<set $mpReturnPassage to "MP Region Observatory Cabinet">><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_dome"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往折光穹顶室 (0:06)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_star"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往星图档案室 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往钟楼连廊 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Bridge]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回翼楼入口 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Observatory Cabinet Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你蹲在玻璃展柜最底层，用铜镊子去拨紫水晶簇空心底座的内侧卡簧。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 370>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 840>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 740>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 640>><<else>><<set _reward to 550>><</if>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>
	<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Observatory_Cabinet")>>
		底座暗格弹开，你翻出了一枚旧港走私王火漆印戒、古矿石标本与王冠齿轮残片。里面还垫着约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的收藏金币。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		你在旋转玻璃架的海螺化石螺口里摸出了几枚绒布包裹的旧银币，合计约有 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
		<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	锋利的紫水晶棱角划破了你的指腹，镊子也在玻璃柜壁上磕出脆响。你连忙缩回手合上柜门。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回标本陈列阁 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Observatory Cabinet Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
你坐在夜光萤石展柜旁的木凳上，沐浴着温润的浅绿色矿石微光静心调息。
<<if $science gte 250 or $willpower gte 450>>
	静谧的暗阁与柔和的萤石荧光抚平了你紧绷的思绪，你靠着展柜安稳地歇过了乏味与疲倦。
	<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
	角落药水柜底层的福尔马林气味顺着柜缝渗出来，熏得你眼眶发涩、鼻腔刺痛，根本坐不住。
	<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回标本陈列阁 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Observatory Bridge [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>
架设在屋顶飞扶壁之间的石砌拱廊装有防风百叶窗，透过拱券可直接眺望近在咫尺的学园钟塔。西侧壁龛里立着一座铜制风速计，风杯缓缓旋转。
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $willpower gte 450>>你稳步走在宽阔的拱窗石台边，俯瞰整座学园的青石屋顶。<<else>>高处穿堂而过的风声在飞扶壁间呼啸，让人有些心悸。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[探摸石兽凹槽 (0:11)|MP Region Observatory Bridge Search]]>><<pass 11>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[拱窗石台小憩 (0:10)|MP Region Observatory Bridge Rest]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[搜寻周边奇遇 (0:08)|MP Region Pool Router]]>><<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Observatory">><<set $mpReturnPassage to "MP Region Observatory Bridge">><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_dome"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往折光穹顶室 (0:06)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_star"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往星图档案室 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往标本陈列阁 (0:07)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回翼楼入口 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Observatory Bridge Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你探身凑近钟楼连廊拱窗内侧的排水石兽，伸手摸向石兽背部的凹槽。
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 820>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 720>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 620>><<else>><<set _reward to 540>><</if>>
	<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Observatory_Bridge")>>
		你稳稳勾出卡在石兽凹槽里的铁皮盒，取得了王冠黄铜齿轮与古董怀表。盒底还压着约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的钟楼修缮余款。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money _reward>><<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		你在风速计底座下的小皮匣里摸出了几枚高年级学生藏起的银币，数下来约有 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
		<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	风速计的旋转铜杯突然刮到了你的手背，拱窗外掠过的寒风也吹得你重心不稳。你急忙缩回身子扶住石柱。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回钟楼连廊 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Bridge]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Observatory Bridge Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
你合上连廊迎风侧的木百叶窗，坐在宽阔干燥的拱窗石台上缓了口气。
<<if $willpower gte 440 or $athletics gte 260>>
	温和的穿堂微风拂过脸颊，俯瞰学园屋顶的幽静景致让你紧绷的身心彻底放松下来。
	<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
	不远处的学园钟塔突然敲响整点铜钟，浑厚的钟声在连廊拱顶间剧烈共鸣，震得你耳膜嗡嗡作响。
	<<stress 4>><<pain 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回钟楼连廊 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Bridge]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
